# Project Activity

## Data Profiling
Reviewed dataset structure, fields, reporting dimensions and data quality.

## Data Validation
Checked missing, inconsistent and duplicate records.

## Data Cleaning
Standardized data formats and prepared the dataset for analysis.

## Data Transformation
Used Excel / Power Query to transform and structure data.

## Monthly Analysis
Performed month-wise billing analysis and comparative reporting.

## MIS Reporting
Prepared structured MIS reports for periodic monitoring.

## Data Quality Analysis
Identified missing and incomplete reporting records.

## Reporting Optimization
Created a standardized workflow for recurring analysis and MIS reporting.
